## 🛣️ API Endpoints (Quick Reference)

| Endpoint | Method | Description | Auth Required |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `/api/v1/auth/register` | `POST` | Create a new user account | No |
| `/api/v1/auth/login` | `POST` | Authenticate and receive tokens | No |
| `/api/v1/vehicles` | `GET` | Search and list vehicles | No |
| `/api/v1/vehicles` | `POST` | Create a new vehicle listing | Yes |
| `/api/v1/vehicles/{id}` | `GET` | View vehicle details | No |
| `/api/v1/vehicles/me` | `GET` | View current user's listings | Yes |

